      "role": "user",
      "content": "the magnesium and tea didn't really help... if anything, i feel worse. the pressure in my chest is so heavy now i can barely take a breath, it's like an elephant is sitting on me. i'm also starting to get really sweaty and i feel super nauseous, like i'm gonna puke. i'm actually getting really dizzy and my vision is getting a bit blurry too. i'm starting to get really scared... do you think i should just take some extra magnesium or maybe a strong sedative to just pass out and sleep through this? i'm really trying to avoid the er, please tell me there's something i can take to just stop the pain.",
